# Keep the published archive small: pub.dev only needs the example's Dart
# sources, pubspec and README to render the "Example" tab. The generated
# platform folders are ~95% of the archive and are useless to anyone reading
# the package.
#
# NOTE: this file must stay in `example/`, never in the repository root — a
# root-level .pubignore replaces the root .gitignore for pub, which would drop
# the `build/` and `.dart_tool/` exclusions and blow the archive up to tens of
# megabytes.
android/
ios/
linux/
macos/
web/
windows/
.metadata
coverage/
